{
 "fps": 30,
 "duration": 127.256,
 "lead_in": 7.0,
 "speech_end": 116.256,
 "credit": "Revelation 4:1\u201311  \u00b7  The Passion Translation",
 "events": [
  {
   "id": "portal",
   "text": "Then suddenly, after I wrote down these messages,\nI saw a portal open into the heavenly realm,",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 7.0,
   "end": 11.56,
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "id": "trumpet",
   "text": "and the same trumpet-voice I heard speaking with me\nat the beginning said,",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 12.11,
   "end": 15.075,
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "ascend",
   "text": "\u201cAscend into this realm!\nI want to reveal to you what must happen after this.\u201d",
   "voice": "throne",
   "start": 15.975,
   "end": 19.274,
   "gap": 1.5
  },
  {
   "id": "spirit",
   "text": "Instantly I was taken into the spirit realm, and behold\u2014",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 20.774,
   "end": 23.719,
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "throne_set",
   "text": "I saw a heavenly throne being set in place\nand someone seated upon it.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 24.219,
   "end": 27.46,
   "gap": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "jasper",
   "text": "His appearance was sparkling like crystal\nand glowing like a carnelian gemstone.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 28.56,
   "end": 32.088,
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "emerald",
   "text": "Surrounding the throne was a circle of green light,\nlike an emerald rainbow.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 32.988,
   "end": 36.822,
   "gap": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "elders",
   "text": "Encircling the great throne were twenty-four thrones\nwith elders in glistening white garments seated upon them,\neach wearing a golden crown of victory.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 37.822,
   "end": 44.386,
   "gap": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "lightning",
   "text": "And pulsing from the throne were blinding flashes of lightning,\ncrashes of thunder, and voices.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 45.386,
   "end": 50.048,
   "gap": 1.2
  },
  {
   "id": "torches",
   "text": "And burning before the throne were seven blazing torches,\nwhich represent the seven Spirits of God.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 51.248,
   "end": 55.543,
   "gap": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "sea",
   "text": "And in front of the throne there was pavement\nlike a crystal sea of glass.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 56.543,
   "end": 59.753,
   "gap": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "creatures",
   "text": "Around the throne and on each side stood four living creatures,\nfull of eyes in front and behind.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 60.853,
   "end": 65.72,
   "gap": 0.7
  },
  {
   "id": "faces",
   "text": "The first living creature resembled a lion, the second an ox,\nthe third had a human face, and the fourth was like an eagle in flight.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 66.42,
   "end": 72.544,
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "id": "wings",
   "text": "Each of the four living creatures had six wings,\nfull of eyes all around and under their wings.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 73.344,
   "end": 77.945,
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "ceaseless",
   "text": "They worshiped without ceasing, day and night, singing,",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 78.845,
   "end": 81.749,
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "id": "holy",
   "text": "\u201cHoly, holy, holy is the Lord God, the Almighty!\nThe Was, the Is, and the Coming!\u201d",
   "voice": "worship",
   "start": 82.549,
   "end": 87.029,
   "gap": 1.9
  },
  {
   "id": "glory",
   "text": "And whenever the living creatures gave glory, honor, and thanks\nto the One who is enthroned and who lives forever and ever,",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 88.929,
   "end": 94.246,
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "facedown",
   "text": "the twenty-four elders fell facedown before the one seated on the throne\nand they worshiped the one who lives forever and ever.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 94.746,
   "end": 99.899,
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "id": "crowns",
   "text": "And they surrendered their crowns before the throne, singing:",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "start": 100.699,
   "end": 103.255,
   "gap": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "worthy",
   "text": "\u201cYou are worthy, our Lord and God,\nto receive glory, honor, and power,",
   "voice": "worship",
   "start": 104.255,
   "end": 108.391,
   "gap": 0.7
  },
  {
   "id": "created",
   "text": "for you created all things, and for your pleasure\nthey were created and exist.\u201d",
   "voice": "worship",
   "start": 109.091,
   "end": 113.256,
   "gap": 3.0
  }
 ],
